.el .ds Aq '
.TH ngx-cert-renew 1  "ngx-cert-renew " 
.SH NAME
ngx\-cert\-renew \- Renew a site\*(Aqs certificate now and reload nginx
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBngx\-cert\-renew\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISITE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Renew a site\*(Aqs certificate now and reload nginx
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Renew even if it is not close to expiry
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISITE\fR>
Site ID or domain
